warning[float_equality]: comparing floats for exact equality
  --> tests/lint/float_equality/bad.jai:10:8
   |
10 |     if total == expected print("equal\n");
   |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: compare the difference with a tolerance: `abs(a - b) < epsilon`
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/float_equality

warning[float_equality]: comparing floats for exact equality
  --> tests/lint/float_equality/bad.jai:11:8
   |
11 |     if sqrt(a) != b print("different\n");
   |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: compare the difference with a tolerance: `abs(a - b) < epsilon`
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/float_equality
